<section class="cover"><div class="w g"><div><div class="ed">Prospectus · 2026–27 edition</div><h1>A school where every child is <em>known</em>, by name, by teacher and by house.</h1><p class="lede">Tarrenhurst School is a fictional independent day school for 628 students from Pre-K to Grade 12. This prospectus covers the three divisions, the course of studies, the four houses, athletics and the arts, and how admissions works.</p>
<p class="cta"><a class="btn" href="{{ PathBase }}/admissions">The admissions calendar</a><a class="btn line" href="{{ PathBase }}/visit">Visit a morning</a></p></div>
<aside class="today" aria-label="Today at Tarrenhurst"><div class="hd"><b>{{ tdate }}</b><span>THE ROTATION</span></div><div class="wheelrow"><svg class="wheel" viewBox="0 0 300 300" width="300" height="300" role="img" aria-label="Six-day rotation, today is Day {{ rl }}"><circle cx="150" cy="150" r="146" fill="none" stroke="var(--gilt)" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M87.0 34.0 A132 132 0 0 1 213.0 34.0 L179.6 95.5 A62 62 0 0 0 120.4 95.5Z" class="seg{% if rl == "A" %} on{% endif %}"/><text x="150.0" y="60.0" text-anchor="middle" class="sl{% if rl == "A" %} on{% endif %}">A</text><path d="M219.0 37.5 A132 132 0 0 1 282.0 146.5 L212.0 148.4 A62 62 0 0 0 182.4 97.1Z" class="seg{% if rl == "B" %} on{% endif %}"/><text x="234.9" y="109.0" text-anchor="middle" class="sl{% if rl == "B" %} on{% endif %}">B</text><path d="M282.0 153.5 A132 132 0 0 1 219.0 262.5 L182.4 202.9 A62 62 0 0 0 212.0 151.6Z" class="seg{% if rl == "C" %} on{% endif %}"/><text x="234.9" y="207.0" text-anchor="middle" class="sl{% if rl == "C" %} on{% endif %}">C</text><path d="M213.0 266.0 A132 132 0 0 1 87.0 266.0 L120.4 204.5 A62 62 0 0 0 179.6 204.5Z" class="seg{% if rl == "D" %} on{% endif %}"/><text x="150.0" y="256.0" text-anchor="middle" class="sl{% if rl == "D" %} on{% endif %}">D</text><path d="M81.0 262.5 A132 132 0 0 1 18.0 153.5 L88.0 151.6 A62 62 0 0 0 117.6 202.9Z" class="seg{% if rl == "E" %} on{% endif %}"/><text x="65.1" y="207.0" text-anchor="middle" class="sl{% if rl == "E" %} on{% endif %}">E</text><path d="M18.0 146.5 A132 132 0 0 1 81.0 37.5 L117.6 97.1 A62 62 0 0 0 88.0 148.4Z" class="seg{% if rl == "F" %} on{% endif %}"/><text x="65.1" y="109.0" text-anchor="middle" class="sl{% if rl == "F" %} on{% endif %}">F</text><text x="150" y="140" text-anchor="middle" class="cday">DAY</text><text x="150" y="182" text-anchor="middle" class="cl">{{ rl }}</text></svg><div>{% if wkend %}<p style="margin:0 0 8px"><b>No classes today.</b></p><p class="muted" style="margin:0;font-size:.9rem">The wheel shows where the rotation stands. Weekend fixtures and rehearsals are on the calendar.</p>{% else %}<p class="kick" style="margin-bottom:10px">Upper School blocks</p>{%- assign bks = tb | split: "|" -%}<ul class="blocks">{%- assign bk = bks[0] -%}<li><span class="t">8:10</span><span class="b" style="--c:{% case bk %}{% when "A" %}#7a2232{% when "B" %}#3f6177{% when "C" %}#a8812f{% when "D" %}#5f7a5a{% when "E" %}#5b3f6e{% when "F" %}#2f4a6b{% when "G" %}#8a5a3c{% endcase %}">{{ bk }}</span><span>Block {{ bk }}</span></li>{%- assign bk = bks[1] -%}<li><span class="t">9:20</span><span class="b" style="--c:{% case bk %}{% when "A" %}#7a2232{% when "B" %}#3f6177{% when "C" %}#a8812f{% when "D" %}#5f7a5a{% when "E" %}#5b3f6e{% when "F" %}#2f4a6b{% when "G" %}#8a5a3c{% endcase %}">{{ bk }}</span><span>Block {{ bk }}</span></li>{%- assign bk = bks[2] -%}<li><span class="t">10:50</span><span class="b" style="--c:{% case bk %}{% when "A" %}#7a2232{% when "B" %}#3f6177{% when "C" %}#a8812f{% when "D" %}#5f7a5a{% when "E" %}#5b3f6e{% when "F" %}#2f4a6b{% when "G" %}#8a5a3c{% endcase %}">{{ bk }}</span><span>Block {{ bk }}</span></li>{%- assign bk = bks[3] -%}<li><span class="t">12:45</span><span class="b" style="--c:{% case bk %}{% when "A" %}#7a2232{% when "B" %}#3f6177{% when "C" %}#a8812f{% when "D" %}#5f7a5a{% when "E" %}#5b3f6e{% when "F" %}#2f4a6b{% when "G" %}#8a5a3c{% endcase %}">{{ bk }}</span><span>Block {{ bk }}</span></li>{%- assign bk = bks[4] -%}<li><span class="t">1:55</span><span class="b" style="--c:{% case bk %}{% when "A" %}#7a2232{% when "B" %}#3f6177{% when "C" %}#a8812f{% when "D" %}#5f7a5a{% when "E" %}#5b3f6e{% when "F" %}#2f4a6b{% when "G" %}#8a5a3c{% endcase %}">{{ bk }}</span><span>Block {{ bk }}</span></li></ul>{% endif %}</div></div><div class="ft"><span>Six-day rotation, computed on the server</span><a href="{{ PathBase }}/rotation">The rotation →</a></div></aside></div></section>
<div class="w book"><nav class="rail" aria-label="Chapters"><p>IN THIS PROSPECTUS</p><ol><li><a href="#divisions"><span>I</span>Three divisions</a></li><li><a href="#day"><span>II</span>A day in the life</a></li><li><a href="#studies"><span>III</span>Course of studies</a></li><li><a href="#houses"><span>IV</span>The houses</a></li><li><a href="#beyond"><span>V</span>Athletics &amp; arts</a></li><li><a href="#admissions"><span>VI</span>Admissions</a></li><li><a href="#calendar"><span>VII</span>Calendar &amp; stories</a></li></ol></nav>
<div>
<section class="chap" id="divisions"><div class="chead"><span class="num">I</span><div><p class="kick">Three divisions, one hill</p><h2>Lower, Middle and Upper School</h2><p>Each division has its own building, head and day, and they share a library, a dining hall and the houses.</p></div><a class="btn sm line" href="{{ PathBase }}/divisions">All divisions</a></div><div class="divs">{% for d in divs.Items %}{%- assign y=d.PublishedContent -%}{%- capture dc -%}{{ y.color }}{%- endcapture -%}<a class="dv" href="{{ PathBase }}/{{ d.RoutePath }}" style="--c:{{ dc }}"><img src="{{ y.art.Value | attachment_redirect_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"><div class="b"><span class="gr">{{ y.grades }} · ages {{ y.ages }}</span><h3>{{ d.PrimaryField }}</h3><p>{{ y.summary }}</p><div class="facts"><div><b>{{ y.students }}</b>students</div><div><b>{{ y.class_size }}</b>avg. class</div><div><b style="font-size:1rem;line-height:1.35">{{ y.head }}</b>division head</div></div></div></a>{% endfor %}</div></section>
<section class="chap" id="day"><div class="chead"><span class="num">II</span><div><p class="kick">A day in the life</p><h2>From morning meeting to evening study</h2><p>The same Tuesday in each division, hour by hour.</p></div></div><div class="ledger">{% for d in divs.Items %}{%- assign y=d.PublishedContent -%}{%- capture dc -%}{{ y.color }}{%- endcapture -%}<div style="--c:{{ dc }}"><h3>{{ d.PrimaryField }}<small>{{ y.grades }}</small></h3><ol>{%- assign dl = y.day | split: "|" -%}{% for s in dl limit:8 %}{%- assign sp = s | split: "~" -%}<li><span>{{ sp[0] }}</span>{{ sp[1] }}</li>{% endfor %}</ol></div>{% endfor %}</div></section>
<section class="chap" id="studies"><div class="chead"><span class="num">III</span><div><p class="kick">Course of studies</p><h2>Eight departments, taught around the table</h2><p>Every course lists its grades, block, prerequisites and units. Signature courses are written by our own faculty.</p></div><a class="btn sm line" href="{{ PathBase }}/courses">The full catalog</a></div>{%- assign allc = get_content_items(ContentType="courses", OrderBy="sort_order asc", PageSize=100) -%}<div class="depts">{%- assign n=0 -%}{% for c in allc.Items %}{%- capture cd -%}{{ c.PublishedContent.department }}{%- endcapture -%}{% if cd == "english" %}{%- assign n = n | plus: 1 -%}{% endif %}{% endfor %}<div class="dept"><h3><a href="{{ PathBase }}/courses?dept=english">English</a><small>{{ n }}</small></h3><ul>{%- assign m=0 -%}{% for c in allc.Items %}{%- capture cd -%}{{ c.PublishedContent.department }}{%- endcapture -%}{% if cd == "english" and m < 3 %}{%- assign m = m | plus: 1 -%}<li><a href="{{ PathBase }}/{{ c.RoutePath }}">{{ c.PrimaryField }}</a></li>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</ul></div>{%- assign n=0 -%}{% for c in allc.Items %}{%- capture cd -%}{{ c.PublishedContent.department }}{%- endcapture -%}{% if cd == "math" %}{%- assign n = n | plus: 1 -%}{% endif %}{% endfor %}<div class="dept"><h3><a href="{{ PathBase }}/courses?dept=math">Mathematics</a><small>{{ n }}</small></h3><ul>{%- assign m=0 -%}{% for c in allc.Items %}{%- capture cd -%}{{ c.PublishedContent.department }}{%- endcapture -%}{% if cd == "math" and m < 3 %}{%- assign m = m | plus: 1 -%}<li><a href="{{ PathBase }}/{{ c.RoutePath }}">{{ c.PrimaryField }}</a></li>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</ul></div>{%- assign n=0 -%}{% for c in allc.Items %}{%- capture cd -%}{{ c.PublishedContent.department }}{%- endcapture -%}{% if cd == "science" %}{%- assign n = n | plus: 1 -%}{% endif %}{% endfor %}<div class="dept"><h3><a href="{{ PathBase }}/courses?dept=science">Science</a><small>{{ n }}</small></h3><ul>{%- assign m=0 -%}{% for c in allc.Items %}{%- capture cd -%}{{ c.PublishedContent.department }}{%- endcapture -%}{% if cd == "science" and m < 3 %}{%- assign m = m | plus: 1 -%}<li><a href="{{ PathBase }}/{{ c.RoutePath }}">{{ c.PrimaryField }}</a></li>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</ul></div>{%- assign n=0 -%}{% for c in allc.Items %}{%- capture cd -%}{{ c.PublishedContent.department }}{%- endcapture -%}{% if cd == "history" %}{%- assign n = n | plus: 1 -%}{% endif %}{% endfor %}<div class="dept"><h3><a href="{{ PathBase }}/courses?dept=history">History</a><small>{{ n }}</small></h3><ul>{%- assign m=0 -%}{% for c in allc.Items %}{%- capture cd -%}{{ c.PublishedContent.department }}{%- endcapture -%}{% if cd == "history" and m < 3 %}{%- assign m = m | plus: 1 -%}<li><a href="{{ PathBase }}/{{ c.RoutePath }}">{{ c.PrimaryField }}</a></li>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</ul></div>{%- assign n=0 -%}{% for c in allc.Items %}{%- capture cd -%}{{ c.PublishedContent.department }}{%- endcapture -%}{% if cd == "languages" %}{%- assign n = n | plus: 1 -%}{% endif %}{% endfor %}<div class="dept"><h3><a href="{{ PathBase }}/courses?dept=languages">World languages</a><small>{{ n }}</small></h3><ul>{%- assign m=0 -%}{% for c in allc.Items %}{%- capture cd -%}{{ c.PublishedContent.department }}{%- endcapture -%}{% if cd == "languages" and m < 3 %}{%- assign m = m | plus: 1 -%}<li><a href="{{ PathBase }}/{{ c.RoutePath }}">{{ c.PrimaryField }}</a></li>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</ul></div>{%- assign n=0 -%}{% for c in allc.Items %}{%- capture cd -%}{{ c.PublishedContent.department }}{%- endcapture -%}{% if cd == "arts" %}{%- assign n = n | plus: 1 -%}{% endif %}{% endfor %}<div class="dept"><h3><a href="{{ PathBase }}/courses?dept=arts">Arts</a><small>{{ n }}</small></h3><ul>{%- assign m=0 -%}{% for c in allc.Items %}{%- capture cd -%}{{ c.PublishedContent.department }}{%- endcapture -%}{% if cd == "arts" and m < 3 %}{%- assign m = m | plus: 1 -%}<li><a href="{{ PathBase }}/{{ c.RoutePath }}">{{ c.PrimaryField }}</a></li>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</ul></div>{%- assign n=0 -%}{% for c in allc.Items %}{%- capture cd -%}{{ c.PublishedContent.department }}{%- endcapture -%}{% if cd == "cs" %}{%- assign n = n | plus: 1 -%}{% endif %}{% endfor %}<div class="dept"><h3><a href="{{ PathBase }}/courses?dept=cs">Computer science</a><small>{{ n }}</small></h3><ul>{%- assign m=0 -%}{% for c in allc.Items %}{%- capture cd -%}{{ c.PublishedContent.department }}{%- endcapture -%}{% if cd == "cs" and m < 3 %}{%- assign m = m | plus: 1 -%}<li><a href="{{ PathBase }}/{{ c.RoutePath }}">{{ c.PrimaryField }}</a></li>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</ul></div>{%- assign n=0 -%}{% for c in allc.Items %}{%- capture cd -%}{{ c.PublishedContent.department }}{%- endcapture -%}{% if cd == "wellness" %}{%- assign n = n | plus: 1 -%}{% endif %}{% endfor %}<div class="dept"><h3><a href="{{ PathBase }}/courses?dept=wellness">Wellness</a><small>{{ n }}</small></h3><ul>{%- assign m=0 -%}{% for c in allc.Items %}{%- capture cd -%}{{ c.PublishedContent.department }}{%- endcapture -%}{% if cd == "wellness" and m < 3 %}{%- assign m = m | plus: 1 -%}<li><a href="{{ PathBase }}/{{ c.RoutePath }}">{{ c.PrimaryField }}</a></li>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</ul></div></div>{%- assign sigs = get_content_items(ContentType="courses", Filter="level eq 'signature'", OrderBy="sort_order asc", PageSize=4) -%}<div class="sig">{% for c in sigs.Items %}{%- assign y=c.PublishedContent -%}<a class="sigc" href="{{ PathBase }}/{{ c.RoutePath }}"><p class="kick">Signature · {{ y.code }} · gr. {{ y.grades }}</p><h3>{{ c.PrimaryField }}</h3><p>{{ y.summary }}</p></a>{% endfor %}</div></section>
<section class="chap" id="houses"><div class="chead"><span class="num">IV</span><div><p class="kick">The houses</p><h2>The House Cup, this year so far</h2><p>Four houses, founded 1903. Points for service, music, sport, debate and the quiz. Bars are drawn from each house's points on the server.</p></div><a class="btn sm line" href="{{ PathBase }}/houses">The houses</a></div>{%- assign hs = get_content_items(ContentType="houses", OrderBy="points desc", PageSize=10) -%}{%- assign mx = 1 -%}{% for h in hs.Items limit:1 %}{%- assign mx = h.PublishedContent.points | append: "" | plus: 0 -%}{% endfor %}<div class="cup">{% for h in hs.Items %}{%- assign y=h.PublishedContent -%}{%- capture hc -%}{{ y.color }}{%- endcapture -%}{%- assign hp = y.points | append: "" | plus: 0 -%}{%- assign pct = hp | times: 100 | divided_by: mx | floor -%}<a class="cuprow" href="{{ PathBase }}/{{ h.RoutePath }}" style="--c:{{ hc }}"><img src="{{ y.banner.Value | attachment_redirect_url }}" alt="{{ h.PrimaryField }} house banner (generated)"><span><b>{{ h.PrimaryField }}{% if forloop.first %}<span class="lead">LEADS</span>{% endif %}</b><small>{{ y.motto }}</small></span><span class="bar" aria-hidden="true"><i style="width:{{ pct }}%"></i></span><span class="pts">{{ hp }}</span></a>{% endfor %}</div></section>
<section class="chap" id="beyond"><div class="chead"><span class="num">V</span><div><p class="kick">Athletics &amp; arts</p><h2>A team, an ensemble or the outdoors, every season</h2><p>Every student from Grade 6 joins something each season. The first squad in every sport takes everyone who comes.</p></div><a class="btn sm line" href="{{ PathBase }}/programs">All programs</a></div>{%- assign prs = get_content_items(ContentType="programs", OrderBy="sort_order asc", PageSize=50) -%}<div class="seasons"><div class="season"><h3>Fall</h3><ul>{% for p in prs.Items %}{%- assign y=p.PublishedContent -%}{%- capture ps -%}{{ y.season }}{%- endcapture -%}{% if ps == "fall" %}<li><a href="{{ PathBase }}/{{ p.RoutePath }}">{{ p.PrimaryField }}</a><small>{% capture lv1 -%}{{ y.kind }}{%- endcapture %}{% case lv1 %}{% when "sport" %}Athletics{% when "arts" %}Arts{% when "club" %}Club{% when "outdoor" %}Outdoors{% else %}{{ lv1 }}{% endcase %} · {% capture lv2 -%}{{ y.division }}{%- endcapture %}{% case lv2 %}{% when "lower" %}Lower School{% when "middle" %}Middle School{% when "upper" %}Upper School{% when "all" %}All divisions{% else %}{{ lv2 }}{% endcase %} · {{ y.meets }}</small></li>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</ul></div><div class="season"><h3>Winter</h3><ul>{% for p in prs.Items %}{%- assign y=p.PublishedContent -%}{%- capture ps -%}{{ y.season }}{%- endcapture -%}{% if ps == "winter" %}<li><a href="{{ PathBase }}/{{ p.RoutePath }}">{{ p.PrimaryField }}</a><small>{% capture lv3 -%}{{ y.kind }}{%- endcapture %}{% case lv3 %}{% when "sport" %}Athletics{% when "arts" %}Arts{% when "club" %}Club{% when "outdoor" %}Outdoors{% else %}{{ lv3 }}{% endcase %} · {% capture lv4 -%}{{ y.division }}{%- endcapture %}{% case lv4 %}{% when "lower" %}Lower School{% when "middle" %}Middle School{% when "upper" %}Upper School{% when "all" %}All divisions{% else %}{{ lv4 }}{% endcase %} · {{ y.meets }}</small></li>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</ul></div><div class="season"><h3>Spring &amp; year-round</h3><ul>{% for p in prs.Items %}{%- assign y=p.PublishedContent -%}{%- capture ps -%}{{ y.season }}{%- endcapture -%}{% if ps == "spring" or ps == "year" %}<li><a href="{{ PathBase }}/{{ p.RoutePath }}">{{ p.PrimaryField }}</a><small>{% capture lv5 -%}{{ y.kind }}{%- endcapture %}{% case lv5 %}{% when "sport" %}Athletics{% when "arts" %}Arts{% when "club" %}Club{% when "outdoor" %}Outdoors{% else %}{{ lv5 }}{% endcase %} · {% capture lv6 -%}{{ y.division }}{%- endcapture %}{% case lv6 %}{% when "lower" %}Lower School{% when "middle" %}Middle School{% when "upper" %}Upper School{% when "all" %}All divisions{% else %}{{ lv6 }}{% endcase %} · {{ y.meets }}</small></li>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</ul></div></div></section>
<section class="chap" id="admissions"><div class="chead"><span class="num">VI</span><div><p class="kick">Admissions</p><h2>Visit in the fall, apply by January 15</h2><p>Families arrange every step with the admissions office. There is no application or payment form on this site.</p></div><a class="btn sm line" href="{{ PathBase }}/admissions">Admissions</a></div><ol class="steps"><li><span class="wh">Sep – Dec</span><h3>Visit</h3><p>Open mornings, tours and shadow days.</p></li><li><span class="wh">By Jan 15</span><h3>Apply</h3><p>Through the admissions office.</p></li><li><span class="wh">Jan – Feb</span><h3>Meet</h3><p>A conversation with a teacher.</p></li><li><span class="wh">By Feb 1</span><h3>Aid</h3><p>Need-based, up to full tuition.</p></li><li><span class="wh">Mar 5</span><h3>Decisions</h3><p>Decisions and aid together.</p></li><li><span class="wh">Apr 10</span><h3>Reply</h3><p>Welcome evening in spring.</p></li></ol>
<p class="muted" style="margin-top:22px">Tuition 2026–27: Lower School &#36;24,800 · Middle School &#36;31,500 · Upper School &#36;36,900. 34% of families receive financial aid. <a href="{{ PathBase }}/admissions#tuition">Tuition and aid →</a></p></section>
<section class="chap" id="calendar"><div class="chead"><span class="num">VII</span><div><p class="kick">Calendar &amp; stories</p><h2>What's coming up, and what just happened</h2><p>Public dates from the term calendar, and the latest stories from classrooms, stages and fields.</p></div><a class="btn sm line" href="{{ PathBase }}/calendar">Full calendar</a></div><div class="cal">{% for e in evs.Items %}{%- assign y=e.PublishedContent -%}<a class="ev" href="{{ PathBase }}/{{ e.RoutePath }}"><span class="dt"><span>{{ y.month }}</span><b>{{ y.day_num }}</b></span><span><h3>{{ e.PrimaryField }}</h3><small>{{ y.date_label }} · {{ y.time_label }} · {{ y.place }}</small></span></a>{% endfor %}</div>
<div class="stories" style="margin-top:44px">{% for s in sts.Items %}{%- assign y=s.PublishedContent -%}<a class="sto" href="{{ PathBase }}/{{ s.RoutePath }}"><img src="{{ y.image.Value | attachment_redirect_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"><small>{% capture lv7 -%}{{ y.kind }}{%- endcapture %}{% case lv7 %}{% when "classroom" %}Classroom{% when "arts" %}Arts{% when "athletics" %}Athletics{% when "houses" %}Houses{% when "alumni" %}Alumni{% else %}{{ lv7 }}{% endcase %} · {{ y.date_label }}</small><h3>{{ s.PrimaryField }}</h3><p>{{ y.summary }}</p></a>{% endfor %}</div></section>
</div></div>
<section class="portal"><div class="w"><div><p class="kick" style="color:#e3c27c">For current families and faculty</p><h2>Letters home, rotas and conference times live behind sign-in.</h2><p>The families portal and the faculty common room are checked on the server. Demo accounts only.</p></div><a class="btn" href="{{ PathBase }}/families">Families portal</a></div></section>
